BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Open Mic & Craft Night: Celebrating the Art of Saber
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260821T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260821T210000
UID:8a3127f7a9f27bc4056543d16e6fe00b@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Open Mic & Craft Night: Celebrating the Art of Saber Fiorica J
 oin us in celebrating the art of Saber Fiorica on August 21. Open mic avai
 lable for anyone who wants to share. All kinds of art are welcome—music\
 , poetry\, acting\, etc. Enjoy performances by community members and hop o
 n the mic yourself! Come ready to craft using provided collage and art mat
 erials\, or bring your own project to work on! Support local creators at o
 ur pop-up\, featuring artworks by Saber Fiorica\, upcycled and handmade fa
 shion from Hysterix Design\, and more. Net proceeds are donated to Buckele
 w Programs. Help us raise money for suicide prevention/mental health servi
 ces and enjoy a beautiful night of celebrating creativity and community. F
 lat donations are welcome via the provided QR code.
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.com/events/details/open-mic-craft-nig
 ht-celebrating-the-art-of-saber
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
