BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2026 Top 10 Employers' Mistakes that Spark Lawsuits and Navigating
  AI Risks
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260910T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260910T113000
UID:f04550bb348dd149ec8ef18a69795db1@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:This informative session will explore the ten most common empl
 oyment mistakes that expose employers to costly lawsuits\, government inve
 stigations\, and employee claims. Drawing from real-world situations frequ
 ently encountered by HR professionals and employment attorneys\, we'll dis
 cuss common pitfalls involving hiring\, wage and hour compliance\, employe
 e classification\, harassment prevention\, documentation\, performance man
 agement\, leaves of absence\, terminations\, retaliation\, and inconsisten
 t policy enforcement. Attendees will gain practical strategies to identify
  risks before they become legal issues and learn best practices to help pr
 otect their organizations while fostering a fair and compliant workplace. 
 Artificial Intelligence is rapidly changing the workplace\, but many emplo
 yers are uncertain about how to use it responsibly and legally. This sessi
 on will provide an overview of how AI is being used in recruiting\, hiring
 \, performance management\, employee communications\, policy develo
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.com/events/details/2026-top-10-employ
 ers-mistakes-that-spark-lawsuits-and-navigating-ai-risks
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Downtown Petaluma Annual Trick or Treat Trail
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T173000
UID:d3f2ec9aa967da09e7397f8deac47e1d@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:A time of bats and broomsticks\, blood and bugs - and Downtown
  Petaluma’s Safe “Trick or Treat Trail” with the downtown Merchants!
  Parents - gather your little ghosts\, goblins\, monsters\, Harry Potters\
 , witches on broomsticks and princesses\, and join the participating downt
 own merchants for the Annual Trick or Treat Trail this Halloween\, Saturda
 y\, October 31 ~ from 3-5:30 pm! Visit the website after October 24 to dow
 nload the pumpkin trail map - listing all participating locations on Kentu
 cky St\, 4th St\, Western Ave\, Petaluma Blvd\, 2nd St\, “C” St\, Thea
 ter Square\, and the River Plaza Shopping Center. Over 75 businesses will 
 be handing out Halloween candy to costumed children. Participating merchan
 ts will have signage placed outside their stores as noted on the map. Come
  and celebrate a safe and spooktacular time in our wonderful downtown!
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.com/events/details/downtown-petaluma-
 annual-trick-or-treat-trail
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
